  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato and cauliflower into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies in a baking dish. Drizzle with olive oil and season to taste with a generous pinch of salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your baking dish is crowded, divide the veggies between two dishes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834014cd9848b9dac04a2ee/step-ed9f1200.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice red onion.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Pick thyme leaves.\n• In a medium bowl, combine a generous drizzle of olive oil, thyme and panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients). Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834014cd9848b9dac04a2ee/step-ff423a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 10 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with the butter and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat. Add Dijon mustard, vegetable stock (see ingredients), light cooking cream and Parmesan cheese. Stir to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834014cd9848b9dac04a2ee/step-9ad97220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the baking dish with roasted veggies, pour over the creamy sauce.\n• Sprinkle evenly with the breadcrumb mixture.\n• Bake until golden, 5-10 minutes.\n• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834014cd9848b9dac04a2ee/step-06d4ff30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the gratin is baking, thinly slice pear into wedges.\n• In a second medium bowl, add a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste, then add pear and mixed salad leaves. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834014cd9848b9dac04a2ee/step-1bf88140.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Divide plant-based crumbed chicken, potato, cauliflower and thyme gratin and pear salad between plates to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834014cd9848b9dac04a2ee/step-610ac850.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
